{"id":"8838fb9cc8ab8d77","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-indiscernible-existence.md","title":"Existence of Indiscernibles","display":"thm-indiscernible-existence — Existence of Indiscernibles","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-indiscernible-existence","aliases":["58-thm-indiscernible-existence"],"display":"thm-indiscernible-existence — Existence of Indiscernibles","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-indiscernible-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-indiscernible-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-indiscernible-existence — Existence of Indiscernibles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2106ba11326cfe10\" href=\"?note=2106ba11326cfe10\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md\">../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"950549c09248b205\" href=\"?note=950549c09248b205\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md\">../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (constructible universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Class}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\)</span> (proper-class sequence of ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (proper class of ordinals) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metatheoretic satisfaction for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\\)</span> (zero-sharp existence predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernible} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\\leftrightarrow\\exists I\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\Bigl(I:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\;(I(\\alpha)&lt;I(\\beta))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_\\in}^{(n)}\\;\\forall\\bar\\alpha,\\bar\\beta\\in[\\mathrm{Ord}]^n_{\\uparrow}\\;\\bigl(L\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi(I\\circ\\bar\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow L\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi(I\\circ\\bar\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}indiscernible} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZeroSharpExists}_S\\leftrightarrow\\exists I\\in\\mathsf{Class}\\;\\Bigl(I:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\;(I(\\alpha)&lt;I(\\beta))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_\\in}^{(n)}\\;\\forall\\bar\\alpha,\\bar\\beta\\in[\\mathrm{Ord}]^n_{\\uparrow}\\;\\bigl(L\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi(I\\circ\\bar\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow L\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi(I\\circ\\bar\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantifier is explicitly over classes: a sequence indexed by all ordinals is not a set in ZFC.</li>\n<li>The members of the range of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> are the Silver indiscernibles for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Class-function typing and indiscernibility are expanded as a metatheoretic class-function clause and the full formula schema; the former two predicate names had no defining atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md","status":"resolved","id":"2106ba11326cfe10","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md","status":"resolved","id":"950549c09248b205","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zero-sharp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (constructible universe, see [[../batch15/